namespace prefix = \"v\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" /--><v:roundrect id=\"_x70405552\" style=\"HEIGHT: 22.75pt; WIDTH: 115.21pt; v-text-anchor: top\" arcsize=\"9830f\" fillcolor=\"#ffffcc\" strokecolor=\"#282828\" strokeweight=\"1.98pt\"><v:textbox></v:textbox></v:roundrect></p><div><div><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp; </p><div><div><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; mso-ascii-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M\">2. 학습비</span></p></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font face=\"돋움\">&nbsp; ● 학습비 : 무료 (국비지원)</font></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><div><div><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; mso-ascii-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M\">3. 지원자격</span></p></div></div></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; ● </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">만 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">25</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">세 이상 성인학습자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; ● </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">취</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">창업과정의 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">취</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">창업 의지가 확고한 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; ● </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지역민으로서 지역사회를 위해 재능기부의 의지가 있는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; ● </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">미취업 베이비부머 세대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">장기실업자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">저소득층 등 취업취약계층 우선 선발</span></p></span></div><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p></div><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><v:roundrect id=\"_x70123248\" style=\"HEIGHT: 21.98pt; WIDTH: 115.21pt; v-text-anchor: top\" arcsize=\"9830f\" fillcolor=\"#ffffcc\" strokecolor=\"#282828\" strokeweight=\"1.98pt\"><v:stroke></v:stroke><v:fill opacity=\"65793.00\" angle=\"-90\" color2=\"#ffff00\" focus=\"0%\" type=\"gradient\"></v:fill><v:textbox></v:textbox></v:roundrect></p><div><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; mso-ascii-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M\">4. 교 육 기 간</span></p></div><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; ● 교육기간 :&nbsp;[붙임]</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 참조</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><v:roundrect id=\"_x70338560\" style=\"HEIGHT: 21.22pt; WIDTH: 115.21pt; v-text-anchor: top\" arcsize=\"9830f\" fillcolor=\"#ffffcc\" strokecolor=\"#282828\" strokeweight=\"1.98pt\"><v:stroke></v:stroke><v:fill opaci